{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 4295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is this famous Google interview\nquestion that everyone gets wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4295,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're shrunk down to the size of a nickel\nand put into a blender."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8341,
    "dDurationMs": 4922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The blades will start spinning in 60 seconds,\nso what do you do?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13263,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would like to think I could duck down\nand miss the blades"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16433,
    "dDurationMs": 1793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Break the thing at the bottom maybe?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18226,
    "dDurationMs": 2085,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Push the blades?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20311,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ask nicely for the blender\nnot to be turned on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23523,
    "dDurationMs": 3504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tie my clothes together, and then like\nuse it as a rope I guess?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27027,
    "dDurationMs": 2877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I was lighter I could maybe catch a draft up?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29904,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Just accept defeat.\n- I mean, I'm the size of a nickel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32115,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what quality of life is that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34284,
    "dDurationMs": 1251,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, resonance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35535,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm going to run to one wall,\npush on it, run to the other wall. Push on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39205,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Run to the other wall, so\nI'm going to tip the container over."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41666,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Honestly, the thing I would think about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43376,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is trying to get to the very center\nof the blades."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46129,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's spinning around me, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47797,
    "dDurationMs": 3504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the actual RPM is probably not that high,\nif I'm standing in the middle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51301,
    "dDurationMs": 5046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I tie my clothes to one of the tips\nof the blades as it’s starting up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56347,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, I get it to swing\nme around and then I woooo!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59809,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But these answers don't cut it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63980,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, I first heard about this problem\nin this book."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66941,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It describes how each year Google received"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69819,
    "dDurationMs": 4421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about 3 million applications,\nbut they would only hire 7000 people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74240,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a 0.2% acceptance rate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76951,
    "dDurationMs": 4547,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So one way to screen out\nmillions of applicants was to use brainteasers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81498,
    "dDurationMs": 3628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the interviewers\nwould make these up for fun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85126,
    "dDurationMs": 3963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We didn't get a list, at that time of\nwhat questions to ask."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89089,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We would share questions among each other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91216,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some of them gained traction,\nquestions like:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93676,
    "dDurationMs": 4130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How many golf balls can fit in a 747?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97806,
    "dDurationMs": 4921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or, how much should you charge\nto wash all the windows in Seattle?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102727,
    "dDurationMs": 4713,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the blender question\nreally stuck with me, and I'm not alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107440,
    "dDurationMs": 6965,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Just lay back and enjoy that breeze.\nThe best model in the world is only going to\nrun maybe 10 or 11 hours,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114405,
    "dDurationMs": 4547,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so we're getting out and when we do, we're better off for it because whatever doesn't kill you makes you stronger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118952,
    "dDurationMs": 3628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The question has been hotly debated\nin Reddit comment sections."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126751,
    "dDurationMs": 5547,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are so many different answers,\nbut which one is the best?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132298,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I try to hide underneath the blades,\nI guess."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134259,
    "dDurationMs": 2502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hide under the blade, probably"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136761,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Great first reaction,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138221,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but maybe that doesn't solve your problem\nentirely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140265,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now you're just stuck inside of a spinning\nblender, so maybe you want to escape."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143643,
    "dDurationMs": 1084,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can I climb the walls?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144727,
    "dDurationMs": 4672,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are there defects in the walls that are\nsufficiently large for me to grip on to?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149399,
    "dDurationMs": 4337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do I have Van der Waals forces that are\nstrong enough to connect me to the wall?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153736,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Am I, like, essentially a tiny gecko?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156489,
    "dDurationMs": 2795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A gecko can stick\nto the wall of a blender,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159284,
    "dDurationMs": 3044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even though neither its foot, nor\nthe glass are charged."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162328,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The gecko's foot has to be pressed\nfirmly against the glass,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165331,
    "dDurationMs": 3963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so its atoms are within a few nanometers\nof the glass atoms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169294,
    "dDurationMs": 5213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then, at any moment one atoms electrons\naren't uniformly spread about the nucleus,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174507,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they might be slightly more on one\nside than the other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178261,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This makes the atom momentarily\nslightly positively charged"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181264,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on one side and slightly\nnegatively charged on the other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185268,
    "dDurationMs": 4588,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The glass atom next to it experiences\nthe pull of this charge imbalance,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189856,
    "dDurationMs": 4338,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so a similar charge\nimbalance is induced on the glass atom,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194194,
    "dDurationMs": 2794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and therefore the electrons in the glass\natom are drawn"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196988,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the nucleus of the gecko\natom, and vice versa."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200033,
    "dDurationMs": 4421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there is a very weak attractive force\nbetween neutral atoms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204454,
    "dDurationMs": 5630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is known as a Van der Waals force,\nand it's what makes geckos stick to walls."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210084,
    "dDurationMs": 2545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's the same force\nthat holds graphite together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212629,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's no actual bonding between\nthe layers of graphene in a pencil."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216591,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like a stack of paper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218426,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The layers only stick because of Van\nder Waals forces."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222263,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now these forces are pretty weak."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224098,
    "dDurationMs": 5089,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But since we're so small, maybe\nthey'd be enough to help us climb out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229187,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This I can almost certainly say,\nwe wouldn't be sticking at that scale,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232273,
    "dDurationMs": 5547,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's because the Van der Waals\ntype interactions are still small."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237820,
    "dDurationMs": 4922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I studied climbing, so that of these types of\nscale, cockroach and gecko, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242742,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it turns out that you have to get\nvery special to do that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245578,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Geckos have millions of tiny\nbranches on their feet that increase"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249290,
    "dDurationMs": 4213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their surface area\nand allow them to mold to surfaces."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253503,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Our hands aren't like that,\nbut ants and cockroaches"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257382,
    "dDurationMs": 4921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "don't rely on Van der Waals forces,\nand they can still climb up walls."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262303,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So maybe a miniature human could too?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265515,
    "dDurationMs": 2085,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The mechanism of a cockroach foot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267600,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I used to know all that\ncockroach feet, is absolutely gorgeous,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271479,
    "dDurationMs": 1502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Same with an ant, by the way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272981,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's two little claws, the tarsal claws"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275191,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "those are things\nthat slap down on a surface and really do slap"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278361,
    "dDurationMs": 5255,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when climbing meters a second... slap and\nengage, despite having no adhesion,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283616,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they have very sophisticated,\nfrictional attachment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287161,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those claws can grip almost anything,\neven glass. "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291332,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While glass feels smooth to us,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293167,
    "dDurationMs": 3129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's actually covered in tiny surface\nimperfections."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296296,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At insect scale,\nthese features are significant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300466,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Ants basically have climbing gear.\n- Oh yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303469,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're like, using these little\nlike axes basically to pick their way in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306806,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We don't have the attachment disks\nor whatever that would be,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310518,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or like the special claws\nor the Van der Waals forces."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314105,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, we have claws, if you're that scale,\nour fingers are claws."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316733,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We have only really got... we have\ntwo claws, really."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319986,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then our feet\naren't great at climbing, I don't know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323364,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, again, at that scale though,\nI don't know, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326534,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Imagine putting a little sharp, spike into your foot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329120,
    "dDurationMs": 4755,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and sharpen your\nshoes, wear high heel shoes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333875,
    "dDurationMs": 1293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You'll be good to go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335168,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now I'm climbing in heels."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338171,
    "dDurationMs": 1543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there's still a problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339714,
    "dDurationMs": 4463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, I'll have to be pretty careful\nplacing each hand and foot slowly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344177,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's going to take longer\nthan 60 seconds to get out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347722,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in that time,\nthe blades will have started spinning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351142,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One mistake and I'm a smoothie."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355104,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Google was looking\nfor a different answer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 358524,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now we’re going to the physics building.\nMaybe they know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361235,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. I really got nothing. I’m stumped."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364238,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is so embarrassing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365698,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We’re in our last year of our degree, we should\ndefinitely know this!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368826,
    "dDurationMs": 4505,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I feel like I could probably swing running\naround the sides and yeeting myself out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373331,
    "dDurationMs": 1501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, if we're just talking about the entropy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374832,
    "dDurationMs": 2962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it should increase at some point.\nSo some sort of chaos should be..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377794,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "None of the system will stay un-disrupted..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380755,
    "dDurationMs": 1918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Take that as a limit to infinity\nand I'll be chilling..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382673,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like using that logic\nif I just like extrapolate..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385676,
    "dDurationMs": 3713,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now that's still too big for me\nto Quantum Tunnel or anything like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389389,
    "dDurationMs": 1584,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Whoa whoa whoa whoa."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390973,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, that is really overthinking it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393684,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's actually not that complicated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396062,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Do you want to hear the best answer I've heard yet?\n- Sure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398439,
    "dDurationMs": 1043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just jump."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399482,
    "dDurationMs": 959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just jump?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400441,
    "dDurationMs": 876,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How would that work?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401317,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Just jump!\n- How?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403152,
    "dDurationMs": 3254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Does that work like that?\n- Jump where? \n- Out of the blender, just go up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406406,
    "dDurationMs": 2877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So whoever told you that is...  \n- ...crazy, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409283,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, does that makes sense to you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411244,
    "dDurationMs": 2794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, it doesn't, but...\ndo you want to hear why that works?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414038,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, tell me how it works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415248,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jumping out of a blender seems impossible\nbecause at nickel size,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 419210,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the wall of a blender is 15x\nyour height."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421963,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It'd be like leaping over an eight story building."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425383,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But watch these clips..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434851,
    "dDurationMs": 2752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did you notice it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437603,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A horse, a dog and a squirrel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439939,
    "dDurationMs": 4087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They all jump to about the same height."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444026,
    "dDurationMs": 3421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is exactly what Alfonso Borrelli,\nthe father of biomechanics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447447,
    "dDurationMs": 4254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "looked at in the 17th century.\nAs he put it, in the same conditions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451701,
    "dDurationMs": 4045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "smaller and lighter animals\nmake bigger jumps relative to their body."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455746,
    "dDurationMs": 4505,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if the other conditions are equal,\nand indeed the limbs and the other organs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 460251,
    "dDurationMs": 4713,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are in the same proportion,\nthe dog will jump as far as the horse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464964,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, sure, there is variation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467341,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A species whose survival depends on\njumping will be optimized for it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471387,
    "dDurationMs": 4546,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "while others, like turtles and elephants,\nthey don't jump at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 475933,
    "dDurationMs": 2795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when you consider the huge variations\nin size,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478728,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean a horse is 1500 times\nheavier than a squirrel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482648,
    "dDurationMs": 3921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's incredible that they jump to\naround the same height."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486569,
    "dDurationMs": 4212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's not because squirrels\nare super muscly or something."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490781,
    "dDurationMs": 3504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Horses and squirrels have similar muscle\nto weight percentages,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494285,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and insects have even less muscle\nrelative to their weight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498247,
    "dDurationMs": 5422,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why do you think an ant can lift\n50 times its own body weight?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503669,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, is it any more muscular? No\nyou guys hit the gym."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 505588,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Come on. Like\nyou're more muscular than an ant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508424,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So how are small things so strong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 512011,
    "dDurationMs": 5589,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well if you look closely at a muscle. It’s made up of tiny units called sarcomeres."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517600,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They act like miniature springs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520311,
    "dDurationMs": 5464,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How far a muscle compresses depends on\nhow many of these springs are in series."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525775,
    "dDurationMs": 5672,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the strength of a muscle depends\nonly on how many are working in parallel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531447,
    "dDurationMs": 5589,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The thicker the muscle, the more springs\nin parallel, and the greater the strength."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537036,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Therefore strength depends\non the cross-sectional area of a muscle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 541165,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as animals shrink,\nthis cross-sectional area"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 544293,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "scales down\nwith the square of their height."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547338,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But an animal's weight\nis proportional to its volume,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550424,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that scales\nwith the cube of their height."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554595,
    "dDurationMs": 4338,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So as you scale down, weight decreases\nfaster than strength,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558933,
    "dDurationMs": 4671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and as a result, smaller animals have much\nhigher strength to weight ratios."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563604,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, you could probably lift, \nyour own weight,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 565773,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like if you were to put your own body"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567233,
    "dDurationMs": 4588,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "weight on your back and squat that, you could now lift... \n100 hundred times."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571821,
    "dDurationMs": 1501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. Let's go!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573322,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And for us, stuck in that blender,\nthat extra strength"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576742,
    "dDurationMs": 3838,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "relative to our weight\nmeans we could jump right out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580580,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your surface area\ndecreases with the square."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582832,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You'd be like a little superman."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 585084,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I see, okay!\n- That's really cool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587461,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I could jump, like,\nliterally out of a blender."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 590172,
    "dDurationMs": 1419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You could jump out of a blender."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 591591,
    "dDurationMs": 1584,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in movies and games"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 593175,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where people are shrunk,\nthey almost never show it like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596929,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Honey, I Shrunk the Kids It was one of my favorite movies\nwhen I was a kid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600182,
    "dDurationMs": 918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I loved that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601100,
    "dDurationMs": 2794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tiny people struggle picking up scissors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 603894,
    "dDurationMs": 2503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They almost get crushed by raindrops."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 606397,
    "dDurationMs": 4296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If it was scientifically accurate, they’d actually be overpowered. "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 610693,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most people don't think of this\nwhen they first hear the question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614447,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The answer almost seems too simple."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 617325,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you ask the right questions,\nyou define the problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620620,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's some really obvious solutions\nthat work, and that's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 624123,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actually true for a lot of problems\nin the real world too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 627251,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now I'm all for obvious solutions,\nbut from the start,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630713,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the answer of jumping out\ndidn't sit right with me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634008,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even this idea of like, I'm\ngoing to jump out of the blender like that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 637470,
    "dDurationMs": 3461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "doesn't make sense to me,\nbecause jumping is not just like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640931,
    "dDurationMs": 1877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "okay, how strong\nyou are relative to your weight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642808,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's also timing\nand your kinetics and all that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 645436,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So like, how long can you be in\ntouch with the ground?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648064,
    "dDurationMs": 4087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How much can you apply that force in\none burst like over a really short period?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652151,
    "dDurationMs": 3795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Would it be\nfair to say you're overthinking things?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655946,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You got to suspend your disbelief\nsomewhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658032,
    "dDurationMs": 4212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think if you like, factor in all the\npotential challenges a human would have."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662244,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just like if they just all of a sudden\nthat size, they don't have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665331,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like time to practice using their legs\nand stuff in that new environment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 669335,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, I don't give them very good\nchances of jumping out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671712,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes there are people\nwho make everything more complex"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 674465,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than it needs to be,\nand that can be problematic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677134,
    "dDurationMs": 1377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would like to see like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 678511,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, realistic modeling of,\nwe scale me down 100 times."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 683391,
    "dDurationMs": 1626,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, can I jump higher?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 685017,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to see someone do\nthose physics equations, yeah,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 688229,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you could jump higher, but you couldn’t jump\n100x higher, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 692233,
    "dDurationMs": 5005,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's why we got the researchers\nat Georgia Tech's biomechanics lab to investigate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697238,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While, they're figuring that out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 699073,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "let me tell you about today's\nsponsor, Incogni."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 701951,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every time you browse the internet,\nsign up for a newsletter, or even just buy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 705788,
    "dDurationMs": 1168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "something online."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 706956,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your personal data is collected,\nit is stored."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710042,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And sometimes sold\nwithout your permission."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 713629,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So how do you escape?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716257,
    "dDurationMs": 4421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, with your permission, Incogni\ncontacts data brokers on your behalf"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 720678,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and requests using proper legal language"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 723139,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that they delete\nyour personal information."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 725850,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So instead of spending countless hours\ntrying to track these companies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 728811,
    "dDurationMs": 4087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "down yourself, Incogni\ndoes all that hard work for you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 732898,
    "dDurationMs": 2545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I started using Incogni\nand within just a week"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 735443,
    "dDurationMs": 4462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "my inbox was less overrun\nand my phone even got fewer spam calls."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 739905,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After a month,\nmy dashboard showed even more removals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 743242,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Companies I had never\neven interacted with, but who"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 746245,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "somehow had my personal information."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 749206,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you want to try the easy way\nto escape the clutches"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752126,
    "dDurationMs": 3211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of data brokers, visit\nincogni.com/veritasium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 755337,
    "dDurationMs": 4338,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can click that link down\nin the description or scan this QR code."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 759675,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Make sure to use Code Veritasium\nto get 60% off"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 762511,
    "dDurationMs": 3671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your annual subscription\nto take control of your data today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 766182,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's incogni.com/veritasium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 769477,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now let's see how that\nsimulation is coming along."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772897,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, so we have our simulated blender."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 775733,
    "dDurationMs": 4838,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We’re 2 centimeters tall and we have to jump at least 30 centimeters to get out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 780571,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was like, well, what about me?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 782323,
    "dDurationMs": 4254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, I'm pretty,\nyou know, embarrassingly non-athletic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786577,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What if I do this? So I did it right here\nnext to my desk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 789914,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My partner sort of measured my jump height,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 791916,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I know how much I weigh\nand all that stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 793501,
    "dDurationMs": 2335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what would it look like for me?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 795836,
    "dDurationMs": 3921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If we have a person\nthat weighs 84kg, is squatting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799757,
    "dDurationMs": 4796,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "15cm and has a jump height of 27cm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804553,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That person, if they were scaled down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 807681,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to 1% of their original size,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 810309,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they would jump 42cm high."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 813854,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The simple simulation\nshows a jump height of 42cm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 818025,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you would make it out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 820402,
    "dDurationMs": 3254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But we need to add in air resistance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 823656,
    "dDurationMs": 4421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since our cross-sectional area is now\n100 times larger relative to our weight,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 828077,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "drag should have a greater effect\nat nickel size."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 831997,
    "dDurationMs": 4588,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If it was 42cm jump height\nbefore for the jumper, with drag..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 836585,
    "dDurationMs": 4755,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "considering drag, then it's about 39cm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 841340,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we do decrease in jump height a little bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 844009,
    "dDurationMs": 4672,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that drag calculation\nis assuming you jump perfectly vertically."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 848681,
    "dDurationMs": 4838,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what if you're a bit uncoordinated\nand you flip onto your side mid jump?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 853519,
    "dDurationMs": 3211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, then you're exposing\nten times the surface area"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 856730,
    "dDurationMs": 3379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that increases\nthe amount of air resistance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 860109,
    "dDurationMs": 3336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like if somehow you flipped,\nand you're still moving up like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 863445,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like what is the air resistance then?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 865406,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So doing that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 868117,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that means 22 centimeter jump height."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 870703,
    "dDurationMs": 1918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh. So we don't we don't."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 872621,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh. Darn."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 874665,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you start getting overconfident\nand you wanted to do,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 877960,
    "dDurationMs": 4713,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, a backflip while you're at it,\nthen you're going to mess it up. Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 882673,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don't backflip out of the blender \nis a good piece of advice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 886552,
    "dDurationMs": 1126,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don't try and show off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 887678,
    "dDurationMs": 1877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're trying to not get chopped up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 889555,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just like, just go headfirst."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 891891,
    "dDurationMs": 2627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not so much getting out\nof the blender."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 894518,
    "dDurationMs": 1794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's what happens next."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 896312,
    "dDurationMs": 4713,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You've got two nickel sized men free\nin the world. Think of the posibilities."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 901025,
    "dDurationMs": 1501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The simulation came back, "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 902526,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can jump out of the freaking blender."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 905487,
    "dDurationMs": 2128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alright, okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907615,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm glad we went through this,\nthis exercise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 911035,
    "dDurationMs": 2919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you want me to do another month\nof research on this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 913954,
    "dDurationMs": 1418,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No. You know, like you've done it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 915372,
    "dDurationMs": 2795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You've done enough.\nYou've done enough. I'm convinced."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 921295,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I feel like jumping is\nan unsatisfactory answer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 924423,
    "dDurationMs": 3504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was unsatisfactory\nwhen you mentioned it in the first place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 927927,
    "dDurationMs": 1876,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you went through\nand you got the simulation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 929803,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you got the model, and you're like, look,\nyou know, our little guy can jump 40cm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 933807,
    "dDurationMs": 1001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are you convinced now?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 934808,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm like, I guess."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 937978,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But like, my spidey sense was tingling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 941398,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Oh was it now!\n- There is something going on..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 944318,
    "dDurationMs": 5005,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're telling me\nthat I have to apply a force"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 949323,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in 1/1000 of a second,\nand I have to undergo"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 952952,
    "dDurationMs": 3878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "278 G's?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 956830,
    "dDurationMs": 1836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm not going to survive that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 958666,
    "dDurationMs": 4879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what I'm getting now is that, like,\nmy intuition was good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 963545,
    "dDurationMs": 3796,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think everyone's intuition was like,\nyou can't jump out of a blender."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 967341,
    "dDurationMs": 2085,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think they're right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 969426,
    "dDurationMs": 918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you may say,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 970344,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well, that's overthinking it,\nbut that's the whole point of the brain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 973347,
    "dDurationMs": 5339,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "teaser is to overthink it is to get to\nthat point where you're thinking about it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 978686,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the detail of like,\nwhat would actually be feasible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 982523,
    "dDurationMs": 2043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A whole lot of things would go wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 984566,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Our hearts have to generate\na certain amount of pressure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 987277,
    "dDurationMs": 3796,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to get the blood, you know, going up\nto our head and going all the way down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 991073,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you take the human heart\nand shrink it down,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 993325,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's not going to be able\nto generate the same kinds of forces."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 996370,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it would be a catastrophe,\nin a smaller size. Controlling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 999623,
    "dDurationMs": 4338,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "air pressure inside these countless sacks\ninside of our lungs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1003961,
    "dDurationMs": 1626,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's an exquisite balance there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1005587,
    "dDurationMs": 4713,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, you try to take that same design\nand squeeze it down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1010300,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would be skeptical that you'd be able\nto keep the passageways open."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1014346,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You wouldn't even be able\nto think this through, because you just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1017474,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wouldn't have the brain structures that we have."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1020561,
    "dDurationMs": 3753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can't fit 86 billion neurons in a nickel sized volume."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1024314,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can't scale cells down either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1026692,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the thing. Like cells are cells."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1029028,
    "dDurationMs": 3628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, jumping out would be, to me,\nseems like your only option, but I don't"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1032656,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "think you're going to be able to jump"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1034116,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because you can't breathe\nand your heart can't pump blood,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1038287,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so you just keel over and die\nbefore you can make your jump."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1043000,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, so if you're a biologist,\nyou think we die."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1046837,
    "dDurationMs": 3795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you're a physicist, you can decide\nwhether we'd be little supermen or,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1050632,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as I believe, incapable\nof fully harnessing our extra strength."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1054219,
    "dDurationMs": 835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What did Borelli know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1055054,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He didn't even have blenders."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1058015,
    "dDurationMs": 1626,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He doesn't know the stress."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1059641,
    "dDurationMs": 5798,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you're an interviewer at Google,\nyou might not even care what the answer is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1065439,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think one of the misconceptions\nthat candidates have is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1069443,
    "dDurationMs": 4254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when I'm asked this question, it's\nbecause they want to see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1073697,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if I can solve this problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1075616,
    "dDurationMs": 1293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's actually not quite right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1076909,
    "dDurationMs": 2043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are five attributes\npeople are looking for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1078952,
    "dDurationMs": 2795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's addressing ambiguity,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1081747,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's breaking down the problem,\nbeing creative, being smart,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1085709,
    "dDurationMs": 1251,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then communication."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1086960,
    "dDurationMs": 5256,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So I guess like none of those five are\nwhether it's correct.\n- Right. "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1092216,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We’re the idiots who went\nand tried to figure out what's the best"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1095302,
    "dDurationMs": 5297,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of those answers.\nUm, yes!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1100599,
    "dDurationMs": 5214,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Google realized that asking these types of questions\ndidn't make much sense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1105813,
    "dDurationMs": 4754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Laszlo Bock, the senior vice president\nof people operations at Google, said this:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1110567,
    "dDurationMs": 4421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the hiring side, we found that brain\nteasers are a complete waste of time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1114988,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How many golf balls\ncan you fit into an airplane?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1117324,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How many gas stations are in Manhattan?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1119660,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A complete waste of time.\nThey don't predict anything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1122079,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They serve primarily\nto make the interviewer feel smart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1125499,
    "dDurationMs": 1627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I just feel like there's that moment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1127126,
    "dDurationMs": 2335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where you're like,\nso are you going to admit you're wrong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1129461,
    "dDurationMs": 5381,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm like, nyah, you know, I think\nthis is further to like, I'm not wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1134842,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is crazy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1135676,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This question is crazy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1137344,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think it goes to your very point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1139596,
    "dDurationMs": 3254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your very point,\nwhich is that like brain teasers like this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1142850,
    "dDurationMs": 4546,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are not good ways to assess whether people\nknow what they're talking about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1147396,
    "dDurationMs": 2794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So although brain teasers aren't useful\nto assess"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1150190,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "job applicants,\nthey are useful for something."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1153443,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, every time we ask this question\nto people on the street,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1157197,
    "dDurationMs": 4338,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to physics students and to scientists,\nthey lit up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1161535,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They had to try to see the world\nfrom a new perspective."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1164913,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's exactly this way of thinking\nthat has led to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1167332,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some of the biggest scientific\ndiscoveries."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1169751,
    "dDurationMs": 4296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Einstein used thought experiments\nto come up with his theory of relativity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1174047,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Euler's solution\nto the bridges of Königsberg puzzle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1177342,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is what inspired graph theory."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1179720,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when Schrödinger wanted to illustrate\nhis problems with quantum mechanics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1183724,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he imagined a cat in a torture box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1187686,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The blender question is admittedly silly,\nbut silly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1190898,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "questions can yield profound answers\nand show us new things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1195068,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think in order to learn something new,\nyou have to be willing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1198238,
    "dDurationMs": 3504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to embrace the ridiculous\nand just go with it."
    } ]
  } ]
}
